levels, and 4 fictitious resonances above 5700 eV for the         9440 1451  127
contributions of the higher energy resonances. The value of       9440 1451  128
9.65 fm was obtained for the scattering radius R'; this include   9440 1451  129
the effects of the far away resonances. More than 90% of the 428  9440 1451  130
